<%#
  The count badges of a list of shipped items (#1918), as Admin -> Required
  Pages heads its add-on pages: shared by every admin screen that syncs
  shipped content.

  locals:
    syncCounts  { new?, outdatedSyncable, outdatedUserEdited, current }; `new` is
                drawn only when given (a list that never has new items omits it).
                outdatedSyncable counts the pages marked Update ready,
                outdatedUserEdited the pages that need a decision (edited on this
                site, or kept and needing review); `kept` (optional) the pages
                kept for this site, drawn only when above 0

  One named object, not loose locals: an include also sees its parent's data,
  so a loose name could be picked up from the screen by accident.
%>
<% if (typeof syncCounts.new === 'number') { %><span class="badge bg-primary" data-sync-count="new"><%= syncCounts.new %> New</span><% } %>
<span class="badge bg-warning text-dark" data-sync-count="update-ready"><%= syncCounts.outdatedSyncable %> Update ready</span>
<span class="badge bg-secondary" data-sync-count="edited-here"><%= syncCounts.outdatedUserEdited %> Edited here</span>
<% if (syncCounts.kept > 0) { %><span class="badge bg-info text-dark" data-sync-count="kept"><%= syncCounts.kept %> Kept for this site</span><% } %>
<span class="badge bg-success" data-sync-count="current"><%= syncCounts.current %> Same as shipped</span>
